#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable Double Opt-in for Profile Group(s) field"
msgstr "Omogoči dvojno potrditev prijave za polje skupin profilov"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"When CiviMail is enabled, users who \"subscribe\" to a group from a profile "
"Group(s) checkbox will receive a confirmation email. They must respond (opt-"
"in) before they are added to the group."
msgstr "Ko je CiviMail omogočen, bodo uporabniki, ki se \"naročijo\" na skupino iz potrditvenega polja Skupine v profilu, prejeli potrditveno e-poštno sporočilo. Preden so dodani v skupino, se morajo odzvati (prijaviti)."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "No-Reply Address"
msgstr "Naslov brez odgovora"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"Specify an Email From Address to use when the system sends an email but a "
"reply is not expected, for example when a user is sent an email for a double"
" opt-in."
msgstr "Določite e-poštni naslov pošiljatelja, ki bo uporabljen, ko sistem pošlje e-poštno sporočilo, vendar se ne pričakuje odgovora, na primer ko uporabnik prejme e-poštno sporočilo za dvojno privolitev."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"Leaving this blank will use the default which will be do-not-"
"reply@default_domain where the default_domain will be the email domain "
"address of your default mailing account also used for bounce handling."
msgstr "Če pustite to polje prazno, bo uporabljena privzeta vrednost, ki bo do-not-reply@default_domain, kjer bo default_domain naslov e-poštne domene vašega privzetega poštnega računa, ki se uporablja tudi za obravnavanje zavrnjenih sporočil."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Track replies using VERP in Reply-To header"
msgstr "Sledi odgovorom z uporabo VERP v glavi Reply-To"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"If checked, mailings will default to tracking replies using VERP-ed Reply-"
"To."
msgstr "Če je označeno, bo pošiljanje privzeto sledilo odgovorom z VERP-ed Reply-To."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable workflow support for CiviMail"
msgstr "Omogoči podporo za potek dela za CiviMail"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"Drupal-only. Rules module must be enabled (beta feature - use with caution)."
msgstr "Samo Drupal. Modul za pravila mora biti omogočen (funkcija beta – uporabljajte previdno)."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable global server wide lock for CiviMail"
msgstr "Omogoči globalno zaklepanje celotnega strežnika za CiviMail"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Unsubscribe Methods"
msgstr "Metode odjave"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"These methods will be offered to email clients for semi-automated "
"unsubscribes. Support for each depends on the recipient's email client."
msgstr "Te metode bodo na voljo e-poštnim odjemalcem za polavtomatsko odjavo. Podpora za vsakega je odvisna od prejemnikovega e-poštnega odjemalca."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable Custom Reply-To"
msgstr "Omogoči odgovor po meri"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Allow CiviMail users to send mailings with a custom Reply-To header."
msgstr "Omogočite uporabnikom CiviMail pošiljanje e-poštnih sporočil z glavo odgovora po meri."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable Double Opt-in for Profiles which use the \"Add to Group\" setting"
msgstr "Omogočite dvojno privolitev za profile, ki uporabljajo nastavitev »Dodaj v skupino«"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"When CiviMail is enabled and a profile uses the \"Add to Group\" setting, "
"users who complete the profile form will receive a confirmation email. They "
"must respond (opt-in) before they are added to the group."
msgstr "Ko je CiviMail omogočen in profil uporablja nastavitev »Dodaj v skupino«, bodo uporabniki, ki izpolnijo obrazec profila, prejeli potrditveno e-poštno sporočilo. Preden so dodani v skupino, se morajo odzvati (prijaviti)."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Disable check for mandatory tokens"
msgstr "Onemogoči preverjanje obveznih žetonov"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"Don't check for presence of mandatory tokens (domain address; "
"unsubscribe/opt-out) before sending mailings. WARNING: Mandatory tokens are "
"a safe-guard which facilitate compliance with the US CAN-SPAM Act. They "
"should only be disabled if your organization adopts other mechanisms for "
"compliance or if your organization is not subject to CAN-SPAM."
msgstr "Pred pošiljanjem e-pošte ne preverjajte prisotnosti obveznih žetonov (naslov domene; odjava/odjava). OPOZORILO: Obvezni žetoni so varovalo, ki olajša skladnost z ameriškim zakonom CAN-SPAM. Onemogočiti jih je treba samo, če vaša organizacija sprejme druge mehanizme za skladnost ali če vaša organizacija ni predmet CAN-SPAM."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "CiviMail dedupes e-mail addresses by default"
msgstr "CiviMail privzeto odstrani dvojnike e-poštnih naslovov"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"Set the \"dedupe e-mail\" option when sending a new mailing to \"true\" by "
"default."
msgstr "Pri pošiljanju nove pošte nastavite možnost »dedupe e-mail« na privzeto »true«."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Hashed Mailing URL's"
msgstr "Zgoščeni URL-ji pošiljanj"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"If enabled, a randomized hash key will be used to reference the mailing URL "
"in the mailing.viewUrl token, instead of the mailing ID."
msgstr "Če je omogočeno, bo namesto poštnega ID-ja za sklicevanje na poštni URL v žetonu mailing.viewUrl uporabljen naključni zgoščeni ključ."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable multiple bulk email address for a contact."
msgstr "Omogoči več množičnih e-poštnih naslovov za stik."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"CiviMail will deliver a copy of the email to each bulk email listed for the "
"contact. Enabling this setting will also change the options for the \"Email "
"on Hold\" field in Advanced Search."
msgstr "CiviMail bo kopijo e-pošte dostavil na vsako množično e-pošto, navedeno za stik. Če omogočite to nastavitev, boste spremenili tudi možnosti za polje »E-pošta na čakanju« v naprednem iskanju."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable CiviMail to generate Message-ID header"
msgstr "Omogoči CiviMail za ustvarjanje glave ID-ja sporočila"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Mailer Batch Limit"
msgstr "Omejitev paketa pošiljanja"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"Throttle email delivery by setting the maximum number of emails sent during "
"each CiviMail run (0 = unlimited)."
msgstr "Zmanjšajte dostavo e-pošte tako, da nastavite največje število e-poštnih sporočil, poslanih med vsakim zagonom CiviMail (0 = neomejeno)."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Mailer Job Size"
msgstr "Velikost opravila pošiljanja"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"If you want to utilize multi-threading enter the size you want your sub jobs"
" to be split into. Recommended values are between 1,000 and 10,000. Use a "
"lower value if your server has multiple cron jobs running simultaneously, "
"but do not use values smaller than 1,000. Enter \"0\" to disable multi-"
"threading and process mail as one single job - batch limits still apply."
msgstr "Če želite uporabiti večnitnost, vnesite velikost, na katero želite, da so razdeljena vaša podopravila. Priporočene vrednosti so med 1.000 in 10.000. Uporabite nižjo vrednost, če ima vaš strežnik več opravil cron, ki se izvajajo hkrati, vendar ne uporabljajte vrednosti, manjših od 1000. Vnesite »0«, če želite onemogočiti večnitnost in obdelavo pošte kot eno samo opravilo – paketne omejitve še vedno veljajo."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Mailer Cron Job Limit"
msgstr "Omejitev opravil cron za pošiljanje"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"The maximum number of mailer delivery jobs executing simultaneously (0 = "
"allow as many processes to execute as started by cron)."
msgstr "Največje število opravil za dostavo poštnih sporočil, ki se izvajajo hkrati (0 = dovoli izvajanje toliko procesov, kolikor jih je začel cron)."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Mailer Throttle Time"
msgstr "Čas omejevanja hitrosti pošiljanja"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"The time to sleep in between each e-mail in micro seconds. Setting this "
"above 0 allows you to control the rate at which e-mail messages are sent to "
"the mail server, avoiding filling up the mail queue very quickly. Set to 0 "
"to disable."
msgstr "Čas za spanje med vsako e-pošto v mikro sekundah. Če to nastavite nad 0, lahko nadzirate hitrost, s katero se e-poštna sporočila pošiljajo poštnemu strežniku, s čimer se izognete zelo hitremu polnjenju poštne čakalne vrste. Nastavite na 0, da onemogočite."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable CiviMail to create activities on delivery"
msgstr "Omogočite CiviMail za ustvarjanje dejavnosti ob dostavi"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable automatic CiviMail recipient count display"
msgstr "Omogoči samodejni prikaz števila prejemnikov CiviMail"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"Enable this setting to rebuild recipient list automatically during composing"
" mail. Disable will allow you to rebuild recipient manually."
msgstr "Omogočite to nastavitev, da med sestavljanjem pošte samodejno obnovite seznam prejemnikov. Onemogoči vam bo omogočilo, da ročno obnovite prejemnika."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"CiviMail automatically fetches recipient list and count whenever mailing "
"groups are included or excluded while composing bulk mail. This phenomena "
"may degrade performance for large sites, so disable this setting to build "
"and fetch recipients for selected groups, manually."
msgstr "CiviMail samodejno pridobi seznam prejemnikov in število prejemnikov, kadar so poštne skupine vključene ali izključene med sestavljanjem množične pošte. Ta pojav lahko poslabša delovanje velikih spletnih mest, zato onemogočite to nastavitev, če želite ročno ustvariti in pridobiti prejemnike za izbrane skupine."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable click-through tracking by default"
msgstr "Privzeto omogoči sledenje klikom"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"If checked, mailings will have click-through tracking enabled by default."
msgstr "Če je označeno, bo imelo sledenje klikov privzeto omogočeno."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Enable open tracking by default"
msgstr "Privzeto omogoči sledenje odprtjem"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "If checked, mailings will have open tracking enabled by default."
msgstr "Če je označeno, bo imelo pošiljanje privzeto omogočeno odprto sledenje."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Database Update Frequency"
msgstr "Pogostost posodabljanja baze podatkov"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"CiviMail records email sent at the frequency you specify. If you set it to "
"1, it will update the database every time it sends an email. This ensures "
"that emails are not resent if the batch job fails, but this may cause a "
"performance hit, particularly for large jobs."
msgstr "CiviMail beleži e-pošto, poslano tako pogosto, kot jo določite. Če ga nastavite na 1, bo posodobil zbirko podatkov vsakič, ko bo poslal e-pošto. To zagotavlja, da e-poštna sporočila niso ponovno poslana, če paketno opravilo ne uspe, vendar lahko to povzroči zmanjšanje zmogljivosti, zlasti pri velikih opravilih."

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid "Default One Click Unsubscribe Mode"
msgstr "Privzeti način odjave z enim klikom"

#: ext/civi_mail/settings/Mailing.setting.php
msgid ""
"This sets the default One Click unsubscribe mode for any new mailings "
"created"
msgstr "To nastavi privzeti način odjave z enim klikom za vsako novo ustvarjeno pošto"

